{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14301332","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14301332","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1430133201:0":{"text":"남편이 살아있을 땐 늘 소소한 것들을 만들곤 했거든.","source_cn":"以前我丈夫在家的时候，我们经常做些小玩意。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA653393AC835837","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1430133202:0":{"text":"내가 설계도를 그리고, 남편이 모형을 만들고. 내가 광석을 녹이면 남편이 그걸로 기계를 만들었지...","source_cn":"每次总是我画图纸，他做好模型。我冶炼好矿石，他再照着设...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E5B3A2EDC79EB40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1430133203:0":{"text":"하지만 지금은 혼자 딸도 돌봐야 하고, 기계를 만들 여유가 전혀 없네...","source_cn":"现在我一个人，还要照顾女儿，已经很久没有做这些东西了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x354DD0276E464F17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:弗瑞达":{"text":"프리다","source":"弗瑞达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}